<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank placed $187.6 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank placed $187.6 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Tuesday it placed $187.6 million in overnight repurchase agreements against government bonds at 9.0 percent.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, call money was unchanged from the close Monday at 6.65 percent.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar slipped to 0.99967 pesos, from 0.99982 pesos Monday.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
